uture of Documentation — 2030–2045","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will transform documentation work substantially."},{"type":"h","text":"AI can assist with"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Metadata extraction"},{"text":"Entity recognition"},{"text":"Automatic tagging"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Semantic search"},{"text":"Document summarisation"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Information retrieval"},{"text":"Knowledge-base generation"},{"text":"Question answering"},{"text":"Document routing"},{"text":"Records classification"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The workflow may evolve from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Manual Filing","Digital Repository","AI-Assisted Knowledge Management"]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A new research paper enters the repository:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Document Upload","OCR/Text Extraction","AI Metadata Extraction","Subject Classification","Human Quality Review","Repository Publication","Semantic Search / Knowledge Discovery"]},{"type":"p","text":"The documentation professional becomes increasingly responsible for information quality, metadata governance, provenance, privacy and retrieval accuracy."}]},{"heading":"Future-Proof Skill Combination","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest modern profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Library & Information Science","Metadata","Digital Repositories","Data","Knowledge Management","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly valuable combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LIS","SQL","Metadata","Digital Preservation","Power BI","AI-assisted Information Retrieval"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This allows the graduate to move beyond traditional library work into digital information and knowledge-management careers."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BLIS/B.Lib graduate can also pursue:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Librarian"},{"text":"Library Assistant"},{"text":"Documentation Officer"},{"text":"Information Officer"},{"text":"Information Scientist"},{"text":"Digital Librarian"},{"text":"Digital Archivist"},{"text":"Archivist"},{"text":"Records Manager"},{"text":"Knowledge Management Specialist"},{"text":"Research Information Specialist"},{"text":"Metadata Specialist"},{"text":"Cataloguing Specialist"},{"text":"Indexing Specialist"},{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Information Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Repository Manager"},{"text":"Content Information Specialist"},{"text":"Corporate Librarian"},{"text":"Research Support Specialist"}]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"LIS knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Indexing"},{"text":"Abstracting"},{"text":"Reference services"},{"text":"Information retrieval"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Digitisation"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Document management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Library/repository software"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature searching"},{"text":"Bibliographic databases"},{"text":"Citation management"},{"text":"Research support"},{"text":"Information evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"500+ record metadata catalogue"},{"text":"Digital repository project"},{"text":"Digitisation workflow"},{"text":"Document-search prototype"},{"text":"Documentation dashboard"},{"text":"Research bibliography project"},{"text":"At least one LIS/digital-library internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA / BLIS / B.Lib in Library & Information Science","Year 1: Cataloguing + classification + information sources","Year 2: Metadata + indexing + digitisation + databases","Year 3: Digital repositories + SQL + Power BI + information retrieval","Complete library/documentation/digital-repository internships","Build a digital documentation portfolio","Documentation Assistant / Library Assistant / Information Assistant","Documentation Officer / Information Officer","Senior Documentation Officer","Digital Library / Records / Knowledge Management Specialist","Information Manager / Knowledge Manager / Head of Information Services"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best long-term combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Library & Information Science","Metadata","Digital Libraries","Records Management","SQL/Data Analytics","Knowledge Management","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the strongest future opportunity is not limited to traditional library administration. A graduate who adds digital repositories, metadata, databases, analytics and AI-assisted information retrieval can move into universities, research institutions, government, corporate knowledge management, digital archives and technology-enabled information services."}]}]}